{"type":"text","timestamp":1790450053840,"sessionID":"ses_f20e0a785ffeY0nzZZDpoRGf2I","part":{"id":"prt_0df23b2bd001v1mmzMVrQLM55d","messageID":"msg_0df2370780019YwejJntE09Wxz","sessionID":"ses_f20e0a785ffeY0nzZZDpoRGf2I","type":"text","text":"The scene renders correctly. I can see the water plane with the depth ripple effect (white sparkles from proximity fade), and spheres at the corners. Let me verify the half-submerged sphere (Sphere at (2.6, -0.5, -4.5)) is visible — I can see there's activity in the middle of the water. Let me run a programmatic verification to ensure everything matches the requirements:","time":{"start":1790450053821,"end":1790450053825},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"resp_chatcmpl-6ab81986cd5a91211b3a8a69_msg"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790450053884,"sessionID":"ses_f20e0a785ffeY0nzZZDpoRGf2I","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"write:13","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"extends SceneTree\n\nfunc _init():\n\tvar scene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\")\n\tvar root = scene.instantiate()\n\tvar errors = []\n\n\tvar we = root.get_node_or_null(\"WorldEnvironment\")\n\tif we == null:\n\t\terrors.append(\"Missing WorldEnvironment\")\n\telse:\n\t\tif we.environment == null: errors.append(\"WorldEnvironment has no environment\")\n\t\telif we.environment.sky == null or we.environment.sky.sky_material == null or not (we.environment.sky.sky_material is ProceduralSkyMaterial):\n\t\t\terrors.append(\"No procedural sky\")\n\t\tif not we.environment.glow_enabled: errors.append(\"Glow not enabled\")\n\n\tvar dl = root.get_node_or_null(\"DirectionalLight3D\")\n\tif dl == null: errors.append(\"Missing DirectionalLight3D\")\n\telif not dl.shadow_enabled: errors.append(\"Shadows not enabled\")\n\n\tvar w = root.get_node_or_null(\"Water\")\n\tif w == null: errors.append(\"Missing Water\")\n\telse:\n\t\tif not (w.mesh is PlaneMesh): errors.append(\"Water mesh is not PlaneMesh\")\n\t\telse:\n\t\t\tif w.mesh.size != Vector2(10,10): errors.append(\"PlaneMesh size wrong: %s\" % w.mesh.size)\n\t\t\tif w.mesh.subdivide_width != 20 or w.mesh.subdivide_depth != 20: errors.append(\"Subdiv wrong: %d x %d\" % [w.mesh.subdivide_width, w.mesh.subdivide_depth])\n\t\tvar m = w.get_surface_override_material(0)\n\t\tif not (m is ShaderMaterial): errors.append(\"Water material not ShaderMaterial\")\n\t\telif m.shader == null or m.shader.resource_path != \"res://scenes/WaterShader.tres\":\n\t\t\terrors.append(\"Water shader path wrong: %s\" % (m.shader.resource_path if m.shader else \"null\"))\n\n\tvar bg = root.get_node_or_null(\"Background\")\n\tif bg == null: errors.append(\"Missing Background\")\n\telse:\n\t\tvar spheres = []\n\t\tfor c in bg.get_children():\n\t\t\tif c is MeshInstance3D: spheres.append(c)\n\t\tif spheres.size() != 5: errors.append(\"Background has %d sphere MeshInstance3Ds, expected 5\" % spheres.size())\n\t\tvar expected = {\n\t\t\t\"Sphere\": Vector3(2.6, -0.5, -4.5),\n\t\t\t\"Sphere2\": Vector3(-4.3, 0.2, 3.4),\n\t\t\t\"Sphere3\": Vector3(4.5, 0.4, 0.9),\n\t\t\t\"Sphere4\": Vector3(-1.2, -0.1, -3.9),\n\t\t\t\"Sphere5\": Vector3(0.7, 0.3, 4.6),\n\t\t}\n\t\tfor name in expected.keys():\n\t\t\tvar n = bg.get_node_or_null(name)\n\t\t\tif n == null:\n\t\t\t\terrors.append(\"Missing %s\" % name)\n\t\t\telse:\n\t\t\t\tif n.position.distance_to(expected[name]) > 0.0001:\n\t\t\t\t\terrors.append(\"%s pos %s != %s\" % [name, n.position, expected[name]])\n\t\t\t\tvar mat = n.get_surface_override_material(0)\n\t\t\t\tif not (mat is StandardMaterial3D): errors.append(\"%s mat not StandardMaterial3D\" % name)\n\t\t\t\telif mat.albedo_color.g < 0.5 or mat.albedo_color.r > 0.5: errors.append(\"%s not green: %s\" % [name, mat.albedo_color])\n\n\tvar cam = root.get_node_or_null(\"Camera3D\")\n\tif cam == null: errors.append(\"Missing Camera3D\")\n\telse:\n\t\tif abs(cam.fov - 30.0) > 0.01: errors.append(\"Camera FOV wrong: %f\" % cam.fov)\n\t\tif abs(cam.position.y - 1.0) > 0.001: errors.append(\"Camera Y wrong: %f\" % cam.position.y)\n\n\tif errors.is_empty():\n\t\tprint(\"ALL CHECKS PASSED\")\n\telse:\n\t\tfor e in errors: print(\"ERROR: \", e)\n\tquit()\n","filePath":"/tmp/opencode/verify.gd"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/tmp/opencode/verify.gd","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tmp/opencode/verify.gd","time":{"start":1790450053833,"end":1790450053863}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_write:13"}},"id":"prt_0df23b2c3001zNO6gAyUWj4XuB","sessionID":"ses_f20e0a785ffeY0nzZZDpoRGf2I","messageID":"msg_0df2370780019YwejJntE09Wxz"}}
